adro:SpecimenMatrix a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "specimen matrix"@en,
        "시료 기질"@ko ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "An information content entity that designates the kind of specimen in which a measurement is made or in which a stated threshold applies."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Held as a designation rather than as a string or a comment because the List states the matrix as part of the threshold it sets, and a threshold and a measured value are comparable only when both are stated in the same matrix. Treating the matrix as a quality of the sample was considered and rejected: what is recorded here is the kind of specimen a document names, not a property the ontology asserts of a particular sample."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf obo:IAO_0000030 .

