    rdfs:label "Agence française de lutte contre le dopage"@en .

adro:AthleteSupportPersonnelRole a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "athlete support personnel role"@en,
        "선수지원요원 역할"@ko ;
    obo:IAO_0000115 "A role borne by a person during the interval in which that person works with, treats or assists an athlete participating in or preparing for sporting competition, and is for that reason subject to anti-doping regulation."@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The genus is taken from the definition the instruments give: any coach, trainer, manager, agent, team staff, official, nutritionist, medical or paramedical personnel, parent or any other person working with, treating or assisting an athlete participating in or preparing for sports competition. The role is needed because the regulation directs violations at such a person directly, not only at the athlete: trafficking, administration, complicity and prohibited association are each stated as committed by an athlete or other person."@en ;
    rdfs:subClassOf obo:BFO_0000023 .

